          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "DSA proof. - Method: Collected at 21 Dutch high schools in Noord-Brabant, Zuid-Holland, Utrecht, and Overijssel. Data was collected with paper and pencil. - Universe: Dutch high school students from 2HAVO/VWO (age 13-14), in provinces Noord-Brabant, Zuid-Holland, Utrecht, and Overijssel."
